    "text": "with Ada.Text_IO; use Ada.Text_IO;\n\nprocedure Show_Simple_Tasks is\n   task T;\n   task T2;\n\n   task body T is\n   begin\n      Put_Line (\"In task T\");\n   end T;\n\n   task body T2 is\n   begin\n      Put_Line (\"In task T2\");\n   end T2;\n\nbegin\n   Put_Line (\"In main\");\nend Show_Simple_Tasks;\n",
